                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "72e72207-348f-3ae3-a0a3-0a94893e4e44",
                        "entry_id": "0a7f0c1f-a945-31d8-af92-8b4db6f1487c",
                        "glosses": [
                            "английское мужское имя, соответствующее русскому имени Евгений"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "0845611c-432a-4c38-b911-66b6a1c98f88",
                                "sense_id": "72e72207-348f-3ae3-a0a3-0a94893e4e44",
                                "text": "Над дорогой, убегающей к городу, взметнулся маленький смерч, он подхватил белый клочок бумаги и опустил его на камни перед лицом Юджина."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "067bf39e-6eee-48f6-b326-6b23000c8892",
                                "sense_id": "72e72207-348f-3ae3-a0a3-0a94893e4e44",
                                "text": "Заграничными были и весь обслуживающий персонал, включая поваров и официантов, и директор турнира ― американец Юджин Скотт."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "62955a1d-b508-47ea-baa2-b3cc097c0dd5",
                        "source_entry_id": "0a7f0c1f-a945-31d8-af92-8b4db6f1487c",
                        "source_sense_id": "72e72207-348f-3ae3-a0a3-0a94893e4e44",
                        "target_lang_word": "Eugene",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Eugene",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f7524a04-b003-3b31-89ca-5a6c0f220306",
                                        "entry_id": "99a89158-c8cd-3a86-aec9-5e57ef34433a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A male given name from Ancient Greek."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1ef30ef3-602b-4df1-a091-82289612d1af",
                                                "sense_id": "f7524a04-b003-3b31-89ca-5a6c0f220306",
                                                "text": "\"Great praise the Duke of Marlb'ro' won / And our good Prince Eugene.\" / \"Why 'twas a very wicked thing!\" / Said little Wilhelmine"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e1068688-7215-44d2-8604-9606d6ffcc89",
                                                "sense_id": "f7524a04-b003-3b31-89ca-5a6c0f220306",
                                                "text": "Eoghan (Owen) is frequently Eugene, and our own O'Curry, though he plucked up courage to prefix the O' to his name in later life, never discarded the Eugene, which, however, is far from being a monstrosity like most of our West-Britonized names"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9399fc98-34b6-33c3-be02-67832781521f",
                                        "entry_id": "99a89158-c8cd-3a86-aec9-5e57ef34433a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A city, the county seat of Lane County, Oregon, United States."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
